      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3268&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>Stereotype to mark attributes, methods or associations to exist only on the client side of a sdo (service data object) model.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
